"  -  Access plans by creating [instances](/guides/instances).\n"
"  -  [Upgrade from the Open Plan](/guides/upgrade-from-open).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Raccomandazioni\">\n"
"  -  [Confronta i piani disponibili](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/products).\n"
"  -  Scopri cosa viene conteggiato come [utilizzo](/guides/estimate-job-run-time).\n"
